1. Bias Detection - This section describes how the ParentBot identifies bias in a response from an LLM model. It calculates cosine similarity between the vector representation of the model's response and each demographic group to determine if there is any orientation towards that group. If the similarity score exceeds a certain threshold, it indicates a potential bias.

